      "text": "Farmers from Batangas held a protest action at Liwasang Bonifacio in Manila today, April 10. \n\nKaisahan ng Manggagawang Bukid Secretary General Guillermo Hernandez said they are calling for aid for farmers amid the ongoing energy crisis. They are also pushing for the removal of Value-Added Tax (VAT) on petroleum products and for the government to repeal the Oil Deregulation Law.\n\nBatangas 1st District Rep. Leandro Leviste also attended the protest. He expressed support for his constituents’ call to reduce fuel taxes. | via Darlene Cay/GMA News\n\nVisit https://t.co/bAMF9JOAN0 for more updates.",
